// name :
"P3878400331" "Destiny Follows"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - PsychicDamperClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2724717869" "Psychic Damper"
// DetailString :
"P2355482432" "Bane Spider Ruben gave you this small device, which you have hidden beneath your outfit. Supposedly, it will protect you from 'low-frequency psychic messages'. It <i>should</i> prevent you from being converted alongside the other Destined Ones."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - ZukorMissiveClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2426792753" "Missive from Baron Zukor"
// DetailString :
"P1671894755" "This note lists the coordinates of a nearby Arachnos base, along with instructions:<br><br><color BurlyWood>Once inside, please accomplish the following tasks:<br><br>- Disable any methods of communication between the facility and the rest of Arachnos<br>- Prevent the facility from masking itself from outside detection<br>- Disable any turrets or other external defense systems<br><br>This will assist our cause in creating a better world for the people of the Rogue Isles. I thank you for your efforts.<br><br>Signed,<br>-Baron Zukor</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef - BaneSpiderRubenSouvenir 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef Name :
"P2293040761" "Suggestion Engine Projector"
// tDetailString :
"P2014932853" "This small metal disk was all that it took to enthrall your rival Destined Ones into following your every command. Though it's no longer functional, it serves as a reminder that sometimes...<br><br><b><color gold>Destiny Follows</b></color><br><br>It began when you were approached by a Bane Spider named Harvey Ruben. Ruben wanted you to infiltrate a cult that was convincing Destined Ones to turn to heroism. You infiltrated the cult's Meeting Grounds and met with Baron Zukor, who was clearly using some kind of psychic influence to control his followers.<br><br>After spending some time gaining Zukor's trust, you discovered a link between Baron Zukor and Longbow. Ruben gave you a spare Arachnos uniform, and you infiltrated a nearby Longbow base in search of answers. It was there that you learned of the experimental device called the Suggestion Engine.<br><br>Apparently, Zukor was using the machine to emit low-frequency psychic 'suggestion' to his followers, allowing him to control multiple subjects without using an excessive amount of psychic force. You confronted and killed Zukor, and took the Suggestion Engine for yourself.<br><br>However, the moment Zukor fell, Ruben informed you that Longbow was mobilizing to take Cap au Diable, and to hunt down the remainders of Zukor's cult. You used the Suggestion Engine to take control of your fellow Destined Ones, then used your newfound army to strike down Longbow before they could mount their assault.<br><br>In the end, the Suggestion Engine lost its residual charge and became effectively inert. While its power may be lost, your peers will always remember the day that they took orders, unquestioningly, from you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBegin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - EchidnaTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P4008787023" "Hmph. I'm sure this is just another scam. Every time something interesting happens in the Isles, it's just another renegade mage or Wyvern deathtrap. It's never anything good."
// Answer Text :
"P2795913800" "Why are you here, then?"
// Page WhyHere Text :
"P774207792" "Sh-shut up! I just felt like accepting the invitation, that's all! I... I'm always rejecting invitations to things, all the time! I just felt like saying yes to one of them, you know, out of pity.<br><br>...<br><br>Leave me alone!"
// Answer Text :
"P4060782435" "Leave"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - AyameTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2010591282" "<color orange>Ayame and Icecap appear to be engaged in conversation.<br><br></color>Wow, Nepal, huh? And you were all by yourself?<br><br>Did... did the spirits actually raise you?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - MartialGloomTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P4134116229" "Whoever has organized this meeting, I do not believe them to be wise."
// Answer Text :
"P346771890" "Why is that?"
// Page Skeptical Text :
"P2265588144" "They summon us to meet with this Baron, and I am led to believe that it is a private meeting.<br><br>This man is clearly valuable to their cause. Once I am granted an audience, I shall simply break this Baron with my fists, and will demand payment in exchange for his life."
// Answer Text :
"P1746697183" "Sounds like you've got it all planned out."
// Page NonOwnerSkeptical Text :
"P347248165" "They summon us to meet with this Baron, and I am led to believe that it is a private meeting.<br><br>This man is clearly valuable to their cause. Once I am granted an audience, I shall simply break this Baron with my fists, and will demand payment in exchange for his life.<br><br><color skyblue>Have the team leader speak with Martial Gloom to cause the mission to progress."
// Page ClosePage Text :
"P856364347" ""

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - ComatoriumTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P397953359" "<color orange>Comatorium leans close to you as you approach.</color><br><br>Which one? Plutonium or nerve gas?"
// Answer Text :
"P3074401325" "Plutonium."
// Answer Text :
"P1983893023" "Nerve gas."
// Answer Text :
"P43444170" "Excuse me?"
// Page Answer Text :
"P1205655826" "<color orange>Comatorium steps away from you, looking disappointed.</color><br><br>Hmph. It figures you'd say that."
// Page Question Text :
"P1217425804" "<color orange>Comatorium puffs himself up slightly, seeming pleased.</color><br><br>Which one do you think... would <b>kill</b> the most people?"
// Answer Text :
"P2862118714" "Oh, then plutonium."
// Answer Text :
"P121135924" "That's easy. Nerve gas."
// Answer Text :
"P77872186" "Is that question intended to creep me out or something?"
// Page Question2 Text :
"P2570802198" "<color orange>Comatorium deflates and steps away from you.</color><br><br>N-no... why? I mean, were you scared? Even a little?"
// Answer Text :
"P360244723" "This is the Rogue Isles, man. You'll have to try harder."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - BloodThornTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P4233813494" "<color orange>Blood Thorn appears increasingly distressed as her conversation with Shock Treatment continues. When you approach, she turns and waves you over frantically.</color><br><br>Oh, thank god! Someone who looks like they might be sane. I was starting to worry that everyone was this unhinged!<br><br>Please, pretend to know me! I can't talk to this psycho anymore!"
// Answer Text :
"P812163042" "Sorry, you're on your own."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - IcecapTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P516845582" "<color orange>Ayame and Icecap appear to be engaged in conversation.<br><br></color>No... well, not really. I was already in my teens at that point, so I could take care of myself for the most part. Besides, pretty soon after the pact I started some small-time jobs in Kathmandu, and by then..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - OmnicoreTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page HasSouvenir Text :
"P4156984050" "{HeroName}?!? What are YOU doing here?<br><br>I thought that I would finally be RID of you, but you keep reappearing! What pleasure do you gain in tormenting me?<br><br>If you persist, know that I WILL destroy you!"
// Answer Text :
"P307231816" "Nice to see you too, Omni."
// Answer Text :
"P3698509694" "You've tried before, and failed. But you're welcome to try again."
// Page TryAgain Text :
"P4130430113" "<color orange>Omnicore grits her teeth in frustration, but says nothing to you. She returns to fiddling with her cybernetic implants.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P2313206972" "That's what I thought."
// Page NoSouvenir Text :
"P1174728945" "<color orange>Omnicore continues her diagnostic work, making a point to ignore you completely.</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - ZephyrTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page HasSouvenir Text :
"P2255368782" "{HeroName}! Dude! Bro! Looking good!<br><br>How you been, bro? It's been, like, WAY too long!"
// Answer Text :
"P3675349154" "Hm. I'm not sure I agree."
// Answer Text :
"P1618026265" "I'm not your 'bro', Zephyr. Women aren't 'bros'."
// Page DontCallMeBro Text :
"P1039535755" "I... but...<br><br>What...?<br><br><color orange>Your words have completely dumbfounded Zephyr. He seems to have lost the capacity to communicate with you.</color>"
// Page NoSouvenir Text :
"P2568780252" "Aw, man... this dweeb is really killing my groove. I've been trying to chat up this chick over here for, like, forever, but he just won't shut up!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - CrosscutTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page HasSouvenir Text :
"P2256080339" "Oh, it's {HeroName}! My most favorite friend! Have these people invited you to their playdate, too? Can we play together?"
// Answer Text :
"P484990438" "Sure, Crosscut. We'll play in a bit."
// Answer Text :
"P4072968420" "I... think I'm done 'playing' with you, Crosscut. You should find new friends."
// Page NewFriends Text :
"P2117119585" "Oh, I have <b><i>lots</b></i> of friends, {HeroName}. They just don't last as long as you do.<br><br>If you don't want to play today, that's okay. We can play... some other time."
// Answer Text :
"P1504241673" "And this is the part where I leave."
// Page NoSouvenir Text :
"P3474345634" "Hee hee... these people want to meet with me?<br><br>I wonder if they want to play. I bet I could make them... smile..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - HollowPointTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1882875631" "Buzz off."
// Answer Text :
"P3552248900" "Nice attitude. (Leave)"
// Answer Text :
"P1394907694" "Whoa, you trying to start something?"
// Page Page2 Text :
"P3235493708" "No, I'm trying to get you to buzz off.<br><br>So buzz off."
// Answer Text :
"P3947938604" "(Gesture rudely and walk away)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - ShockTreatmentTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2820277637" "<color orange>Shock Treatment is talking rapidly at Blood Thorn.</color><br><br>And so then I was like, 'Back off, you good-for-nothing excuse for a toaster oven! I told you that I'm not interested, so just leave me alone!'<br><br>But the thing doesn't let up, it keeps buzzing at me like I'm going to change my mind! I think it's been talking with the refrigerator behind my back, so I..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - SavageSirenTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3360678562" "I can't believe this. We get called in here like it's some big opportunity and then they make us WAIT to go talk to some self-appointed Baron? Who do these people think they are?"
// Answer Text :
"P2077639931" "You have somewhere more important to be?"
// Page Page2 Text :
"P1821247842" "<color orange>Savage Siren glares at you.</color><br><br>Great. And now I've got <b><i>wannabes</b></i> talking trash to me, while I wait. This day just couldn't get any better."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - StarduskTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P4081241615" "GOD, I'm so bored! I've been sitting here for ages!<br><br><color orange>Stardusk turns idly in your direction.</color><br><br>Hey, {HeroName}. Wanna start a fight or something? Would liven the place up a little..."
// Answer Text :
"P1568786260" "Maybe later, Stardusk."
// Page Page2 Text :
"P2626566465" "<color orange>Stardusk shrugs lazily, looking off into the distance.</color><br><br>Suit yourself."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - MangleTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1865364140" "<color orange>Mangle is staring off into the distance, looking sullen. He turns his nose up at you as you approach.</color><br><br>And who are you supposed to be?"
// Answer Text :
"P2164353589" "I go by {HeroName}."
// Page Page2 Text :
"P388156186" "Yeah? Well let me enlighten you a bit, {HeroName}. Being in the same room as me? It's not good for your health."
// Answer Text :
"P4042927296" "I'll take my chances. (Leave)"
// Answer Text :
"P56317927" "*My* health should be the least of your concerns, Mangle."
// Page Page3 Text :
"P1722487501" "<color orange>Mangle stiffens a bit, then looks away.</color><br><br>Hmph. Not worth my time, anyway."
// Answer Text :
"P2389362833" "Smart man."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - MissThystleTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1045823585" "Hey, {HeroName}, right? I've heard of you.<br><br>So what do you know about this Zukor guy?"
// Answer Text :
"P868773913" "Not much. Up until now I didn't even know his name."
// Page Page2 Text :
"P2115982817" "<color orange>Miss Thystle frowns in thought.</color><br><br>I was hoping you'd know something I didn't. All I've heard is that he's going to try to convince us to work as Heroes. Can you imagine?<br><br><color orange>Miss Thystle looks at you skeptically.</color><br><br>I mean, it can't be that simple, can it? We can't just... switch like that, right?"
// Answer Text :
"P1972748972" "I guess we'll find out soon enough."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - BlastFurnaceTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P493974815" "<color orange>Blast Furnace appears to be deeply engaged in a conversation with Zephyr.</color><br><br>...but then I meet people who have such interesting origin stories, you know? I mean, I'm just a guy that happens to be on fire. I'm not the wind or some alien survivor... sometimes I just wonder if I should just get some help. Like, a psychiatrist or something."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - ConvertedGloomTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3732025388" "I... I cannot describe him properly, {HeroName}. He is like the face of inspiration itself.<br><br>Under his gaze, I have seen my life as it truly is, and I have found it lacking. I believe it is time that I mended my ways."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - ZukorTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Start Text :
"P3101580564" "Hello, my friend. You are... {HeroName}, are you not?"
// Answer Text :
"P4191181315" "That's me."
// Page Page2 Text :
"P2070143863" "Fantastic. I've been looking forward to speaking with you, {HeroName}. To be honest, I did not expect you to seek me out so soon... but I believe that you and I have much to discuss."
// Answer Text :
"P501039500" "Such as...?"
// Page Page3 Text :
"P2309638136" "<color orange>Baron Zukor begins to stare at you intently.</color><br><br>Your reputation precedes you, {HeroName}. The deeds you have performed in your budding career... as a <b><i>Villain</i></b>... have caused quite a stir. But I say to you now... this life is <b><i>not</i></b> what was meant for you. You have been led <b><i>astray</b></i>.<br><br><color orange>As Zukor speaks, the device in your ear begins to buzz. The feeling is almost imperceptible.</color><br><br>I think that you should <b><i>reexamine</b></i> your life, {HeroName}, and perhaps try to <b><i>find a new path</b></i>. I think that would be for the best, don't you?<br><br><color orange>The buzzing in your ear becomes steadily stronger, until you begin to worry that Zukor might take notice of the device.<br><br></color>Well? Don't you?"
// Answer Text :
"P752963366" "(Lie) Yes... I think I should change my ways."
// Page Page4 Text :
"P1150244886" "<color orange>Baron Zukor relaxes, and smiles at you. Immediately, the buzzing in your ear fades to silence.</color><br><br>Good. I'm glad we agree. Go now, and contemplate your newfound wisdom. I believe we will be able to do great things together, when the time comes."
// Answer Text :
"P2962197782" "Yes, Baron."
// Page NotOwner Text :
"P1932878120" "<color skyblue>Only the team leader can cause the mission to progress though dialogue."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - GigaWattsTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page MangleNotFought Text :
"P3052315706" "<color orange>Giga Watts leans in close to you.</color><br><br>Listen, {HeroName}. You've spoken with the Baron, so I know you're on our side, now. I'm gonna need to ask for your help."
// Answer Text :
"P3885963942" "Sure, what do you need?"
// Page MangleNotFought2 Text :
"P3008370444" "It looks like there's a bit of a commotion going on in the waiting area. I'd check it out myself, but it's very important that Pyra and I maintain our posts - we can't risk exposing the Baron to anyone who might seek to harm him.<br><br>Can you go take a look at what's happening, and see if you can get things back under control?"
// Answer Text :
"P4135781192" "Leave it to me."
// Page MangleFought Text :
"P4151429503" "{HeroName}, you're back. Have you handled the problem?"
// Answer Text :
"P1059361478" "Mangle was causing a commotion. I had to take him down."
// Page NiceWork Text :
"P183756469" "Good work, {HeroName}. The Baron needs capable people that he can trust, and it looks like you're one of them. You do good work.<br><br>Why don't you go meditate on your conversation with the Baron? I know that after he spoke with me, I had a lot of thinking to do. I don't want to interrupt your spiritual journey with mundane tasks. When we need your help, we'll send for you."
// Answer Text :
"P3063056430" "Thanks, Watts. I'll see you around."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - AngryMangleTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Start Text :
"P3287316973" "<color orange>Mangle snarls at you as you approach.</color><br><br>This Zukor character is a joke! You people just walk in there and two minutes later you're singing his praises and acting like samaritans?<br><br>I don't buy it!"
// Answer Text :
"P3737991257" "You don't want to push this, Mangle."
// Page FightingWords Text :
"P4180301870" "I do, {HeroName}. I really, <i>really</i> do!"
// Answer Text :
"P2953927015" "Oh, this will be fun."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P383667573" "We don't have a lot to work with, but my agents have managed to scrounge up some details on where the Destined Ones are being converted. So far, the only info we've been getting has been rumors and word-of-mouth, but I'm fairly sure we've located the place they're calling the Meeting Grounds. It's an old warehouse on the outskirts of the city - we've got some scouts keeping tabs on the place, and it's been seeing a lot of traffic lately.<br><br>From the reports I've been getting, it sounds like you'd fit right in with the crowd there. You should be able to get in without having to make up too much of a story. Word's been spreading fast."
// AcceptString :
"P966188276" "Alright, so I can get in easily. Then what?"
// SendOffString :
"P3820260095" "Once you're in, keep your head down and do what you think is expected of you. Right now we're just looking to gather some info. Fortunately, I'm guessing that whoever's running the show won't be too concerned about spies. They'll be expecting hostility - they're recruiting Villains, after all - but they're probably confident enough in their conversions that no one will be able to cause trouble.<br><br>With the Psychic Damper, you should be mostly immune. If you hear the device starting to buzz a little bit, that means it's absorbing incoming psionic signals. In other words, it means someone's trying to fiddle with your mind. As long as you stay alert, you should be able to act like you've been converted at the appropriate time.<br><br>Good luck, {HeroName}. If we can get you into their good graces, we'll be able to plan our next move from a much more advantageous position."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P237061778" "Infiltrate the Meeting Grounds"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P178298247" "We need them to trust you, {HeroName}. If you can't achieve that, then this whole operation will fall apart around us."
// TaskTitle :
"P4064637076" "<color deepskyblue>Destiny Follows</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2999514434" "<color deepskyblue>Part One: Hi, My Name is {HeroName}, and I'm a Villain</color>"

