// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3383608100" "Nothing"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3855143635" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor red> {HeroName}, we may have a problem.<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor red>I just intercepted a flurry of Longbow comm traffic. Given the timing, I think they've been monitoring Zukor's life signs.<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor red>They appear to be mobilizing for an assault of some kind. I'm not sure if their target is the Meeting Grounds or Aeon City.<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor red>Gain control of the cult as soon as you can. Right now, they're the only force able to stop Longbow."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2857077758" "Hmph. Your 'Baron' may be in for a rough surprise."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1230392216" "{HeroName}? What are you doing up here?"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2917107199" "They're waiting for you in the back room, {HeroName}. Go on in."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3828627299" "<t 10><t 5>Yes, Baron. Of the nine bases we attacked, seven are now completely nonoperational, and are currently serving as outposts for Longbow.<t 0>The two that remain are currently operating with a skeleton crew, due to battle casualties. We don't expect heavy interference from them in the near future."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3514462294" "..."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2730890729" "<t 25><t 5>Most of us were ready for large-scale combat when we joined.<t 5>I've been working with the few who have... trouble... working in a group environment.<t 0>We're not at peak cohesion for a unit this size, but I think we'll be able to coordinate our attack effectively enough."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2807193716" "<t 45><t 5>Surprisingly, Arachnos has barely reacted at all. I'm a bit suspicious; normally you'd expect some degree of counterattack.<t 8>Plus, there are the transmissions I mentioned...<t 13>But... but Baron! All of the evidence points to a member of the-<t 0>..."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2049737680" "<t 2>Baron, I feel that I must voice my concern in this matter.<t 0>I do not believe that it is wise to expose yourself to possible attempts-"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1293241925" "<t 71><t 10>The only Arachnos forces that would pose any immediate threat are centered around Aeon City. The rest have been crippled or captured by our earlier operations.<t 0>I would focus our next attack on the main Administration building in Aeon. Once that has been taken, the others will not be able to network effectively, which will allow us to take each one individually."
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P446724176" "No... this should not be happening..."
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P3672975259" "Uuugh..."
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P117827910" "<face=marker:ZukorFace>"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2499925080" "<t 5>{HeroName}. Thank you for joining us on such short notice.<t 15>Now that everyone is here, we can begin the meeting. Giga Watts, you have the data regarding our recent incursions?<t 20>Excellent. Double Tap, how prepared are my followers to assist in the upcoming campaign?<t 13>Fair enough. Pyra, what news do we have of Arachnos's reaction to our efforts?<t 8>Pyra, we've discussed this. I know you're trying to watch for danger...<t 5>I need you to TRUST me, Pyra. I have personally ensured the loyalty of every member of our organization.<t 10>Now. Moving on. Towering Inferno, what forces does Arachnos have remaining in the area?<t 10>Do you have a recommendation for our next target?<t 5>Excellent. I believe that we can adjourn this meeting...<t 0>Any questions?"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P600866261" "<t 2>You are all dismissed. I will send for each of you at the appropriate time.<t 0>Come, {HeroName}."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1109542541" "Oh, {HeroName}... you have something to add?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CutScene 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CutScene 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// 4 Caption :
"P826442364" "<x=0.5 y=0.2 t=6 d=5><scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor DimGray>You search through Zukor's things and find a small silver disk pinned to his chest - the projector attuned to the Suggestion Engine."
// 5 Caption :
"P1694338067" "<x=0.5 y=0.2 t=6 d=5><scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor DimGray>With Zukor out of the way, you should be able to use the Suggestion Engine without interference."
// 5 Caption :
"P3041701946" "<x=0.5 y=0.2 t=6 d=5><scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor DimGray>An army of Destined Ones awaits a leader to guide them. It's time to take the reins for yourself."

